---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
---

<section
  class="founder-brief"
  id="founder-brief"
  aria-labelledby="founderBriefHeading"
>
  <div class="wrap founder-grid" data-reveal>
    <div class="founder-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">For founders & the people building with them</p><h2
        id="founderBriefHeading"
      >
        The next stage of your business<br />is a people decision.
      </h2><p>
        A critical hire. A team that has outgrown informal HR. A founder story
        that needs to be heard. Start with the decision in front of you.
      </p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/#service-enquiry"
        >Bring us the brief <Arrow diagonal /></a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="brief-agenda">
      <p class="agenda-title">Three questions we start with</p><ol>
        <li>
          <span>01</span><div>
            <h3>What needs to change?</h3><p>
              The business outcome, the team context and what is getting in the
              way.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li><li>
          <span>02</span><div>
            <h3>What does good look like?</h3><p>
              A clear brief, useful deliverables and responsibilities agreed
              together.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li><li>
          <span>03</span><div>
            <h3>What should stay in your control?</h3><p>
              Your systems, your information and your final decisions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol><a href="/working-examples/">See the shape of the work <Arrow /></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .founder-brief {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 76px 0;
    background: #f8fafc;
  }
  .founder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--blue);
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 3.2vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  .founder-intro > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 48ch;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .text-link {
    margin-top: 28px;
    color: var(--blue);
  }
  .brief-agenda {
    border-top: 2px solid var(--blue);
    padding-top: 22px;
  }
  .agenda-title {
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #475569;
  }
  ol {
    padding: 0;
    margin: 10px 0 20px;
    list-style: none;
  }
  li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 24px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  li > span {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-size: 11px;
    padding-top: 3px;
  }
  h3 {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 17px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  li p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .brief-agenda > a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
    color: var(--blue);
    min-height: 44px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .founder-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 36px;
    }
    .founder-brief {
      padding: 52px 0;
    }
  }
</style>
